  "description": "Recently Refurbished Two-Bedroom Own-Door Apartment – Whiteoaks\nREA McGee are delighted to present this beautifully refurbished two-bedroom own-door apartment to the rental market. This bright and spacious property has recently undergone refurbishment and offers modern, comfortable accommodation in a highly convenient location.\n\nThe apartment briefly comprises an entrance hall, generously proportioned living/dining room, a newly refurbished modern kitchen, two double bedrooms and a stylishly refurbished main bathroom with walk-in shower.\n\nThe property benefits from new contemporary finishes throughout, including modern flooring, upgraded kitchen units and worktops, and a fresh, modern bathroom, making it ready for immediate occupation.\n\nWhiteoaks is ideally located within walking distance of the LUAS and UCD, while the popular villages of Dundrum and Ranelagh are also within easy reach. The area is well served by public transport, including the No. 11 bus, with a stop conveniently located at the entrance to Whiteoaks. A parade of local shops is also less than a five-minute walk away.\n\nAccommodation includes:\n\nOwn-door entrance\n\nEntrance hall\n\nSpacious living/dining room\n\nRecently refurbished kitchen\n\nTwo double bedrooms\n\nRecently refurbished main bathroom\n\nModern flooring and finishes throughout\n\nPLEASE REPLY BY EMAIL ONLY, INCLUDING YOUR MOBILE PHONE NUMBER, TO ARRANGE A VIEWING.\n",
